Starred arguments that come from a list bound to a name are no longer unpacked
using the elements of the original list literal, since the list may have been
appended to or extended after it was built. This fixes a false positive
``no-value-for-parameter`` in pylint on calls like ``f(*lst)`` after
``lst.append(...)``.

Refs #3478
Closes pylint-dev/pylint#4546
Refs pylint-dev/pylint#4554
